# Documentation & status

When architecture, security, deploy, config, or ops behavior changes:

- Update the relevant guide/runbook and applicable phase/status record.
- Record real test commands/results, env changes, migrations, risks.
- Distinguish verified vs planned. Never mark an exception resolved without evidence.
- Never mark a phase complete merely because planned code was written.
- Prefer updating existing `docs/` files over inventing parallel docs.
